//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Suiyuan_Wall.JPG"}},{"id":"hohhot_sacred_heart_cathedral_hohhot","areaId":"hohhot","name":"Sacred Heart Cathedral, Hohhot","category":"monument","tags":["history","photo"],"location":{"lat":40.81062,"lng":111.64653},"visitMinutes":45,"priceLevel":0,"photoSeed":"hohhot_sacred_heart_cathedral_hohhot","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsDepicts":0,"commonsNearby":4,"wikiPageviews":64,"wikidataSitelinks":4,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-24"},"hashtags":["sacredheartcathedralhohhot","hohhot"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"The Sacred Heart Cathedral is a Catholic cathedral in Hohhot, Inner Mongolia, China. It is the seat of the bishop of the Roman Catholic Archdiocese of Suiyuan. The construction of the cathedral began in 1922 and it became the cathedral of the diocese in 1924.","summarySource":"wikipedia","wikipediaTitle":"Sacred Heart Cathedral, Hohhot","names":{"zh":"呼和浩特天主教堂"},"photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d0/Hohhot_Cathedral.jpg","thumb":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d0/Hohhot_Cathedral.jpg","w":1200,"h":1273,"author":"Zophas","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hohhot_Cathedral.jpg"}},{"id":"hohhot_wv_xf5a54d90","areaId":"hohhot","name":"内蒙古博物院","category":"landmark","tags":["photo"],"location":{"lat":40.837,"lng":111.732},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"hohhot_wv_xf5a54d90","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.nmgbwy.com/","official":true}],"signals":{"commonsNearby":52,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-24"},"hashtags":["内蒙古博物院hohhot","hohhot"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"09:00","close":"17:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"17:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"17:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"17:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"17:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"17:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"17:00"}]},"summary":"内蒙唯一一家一级博物馆。三层十余个常展，覆盖了古生物化石、航天科技、历史文物、民族风情等诸多方面。镇馆之宝匈奴金冠十分漂亮。博物馆边上即是乌兰恰特大剧院和万达广场。","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"zh:呼和浩特","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/20230608_Inner_Mongolia_Museum_and_Wulanqiate.jpg/1280px-20230608_Inner_Mongolia_Museum_and_Wulanqiate.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/20230608_Inner_Mongolia_Museum_and_Wulanqiate.jpg/500px-20230608_Inner_Mongolia_Museum_and_Wulanqiate.jpg","w":1200,"h":900,"author":"Yumeto","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20230608_Inner_Mongolia_Museum_and_Wulanqiate.jpg"}},{"id":"hohhot_wv_x1869a77d","areaId":"hohhot","name":"大召","category":"landmark","tags":["photo"],"location":{"lat":40.798,"lng":111.647},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"hohhot_wv_x1869a77d","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsNearby":50,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-24"},"hashtags":["大召hohhot","hohhot"],"summary":"阿勒坦汗曾尊索南嘉措为达赖转世（三世达赖），修建寺庙，恭迎西藏法师来开光，蒙古右翼诸部从此完全皈依黄教；这座寺庙就是大召。大召规模较大，建筑以中式为主，大雄宝殿内有保存良好的银佛、龙雕、壁画，并称三绝。寺门处有号称“九边第一井”的玉泉井。寺外即为塞上老街，明清时十分繁华，如今则修缮为仿古商业步行街，开满了内容大同小异的特产店铺。","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"zh:呼和浩特","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0e/Dazhao_Temple_%2854071745758%29.jpg/1280px-Dazhao_Temple_%2854071745758%29.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0e/Dazhao_Temple_%2854071745758%29.jpg/500px-Dazhao_Temple_%2854071745758%29.jpg","w":1200,"h":800,"author":"xiquinhosilva","license":"CC BY 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dazhao_Temple_(54071745758).jpg"}},{"id":"hohhot_wv_xc3eb680b","areaId":"hohhot","name":"内蒙古工业大学建筑馆","category":"landmark","tags":["photo"],"location":{"lat":40.84594,"lng":111.67764},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"hohhot_wv_xc3eb680b","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsNearby":2,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-24"},"hashtags":["内蒙古工业大学建筑馆hohhot","hohhot"],"summary":"穿过安静的教学楼和热闹的球场，这座工厂厂房改建的建筑系教学楼颇令人惊喜。素描和模型随处可见，学生与老师来来往往，楼梯的设置和空间的划分完全没有一般教学楼的死板，逛着逛着，不小心就来到了咖啡厅，或是党委书记的办公室。","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"zh:呼和浩特","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/29/%E5%86%85%E8%92%99%E5%8F%A4%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6%E5%B7%A5%E4%B8%9A%E9%A6%86.jpg/1280px-%E5%86%85%E8%92%99%E5%8F%A4%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6%E5%B7%A5%E4%B8%9A%E9%A6%86.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/29/%E5%86%85%E8%92%99%E5%8F%A4%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6%E5%B7%A5%E4%B8%9A%E9%A6%86.jpg/500px-%E5%86%85%E8%92%99%E5%8F%A4%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6%E5%B7%A5%E4%B8%9A%E9%A6%86.jpg","w":1200,"h":674,"author":"三猎","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%86%85%E8%92%99%E5%8F%A4%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6%E5%B7%A5%E4%B8%9A%E9%A6%86.jpg"}},{"id":"hohhot_wv_x3c9baa57","areaId":"hohhot","name":"五塔寺","category":"landmark","tags":["photo"],"location":{"lat":40.7975,"lng":111.6579},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"hohhot_wv_x3c9baa57","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsNearby":2,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-24"},"hashtags":["五塔寺hohhot","hohhot"],"summary":"作为寺庙，慈灯寺的地位并不出众，不是“大召”也不是“小召”。但庄严壮观的金刚座舍利宝塔却独占风头，甚至寺庙都因其而改叫做了“五塔寺”。五塔为砖石结构，造形独特，表面布满精美的砖雕；拱门匾额为蒙、汉、藏三种文字，金刚座上雕刻的经文则是蒙、藏、梵三种文字。塔后山墙上还有三幅石刻图，包括全国现存唯一一副以少数民族文字标注的石刻天文图。慈灯寺原先已毁，如今已在原址上依原貌复建，颇为修旧如旧的感觉，寺内还设有呼市召庙文化展。","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"zh:呼和浩特","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/25/A_picture_from_China_every_day_300.jpg/1280px-A_picture_from_China_every_day_300.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/25/A_picture_from_China_every_day_300.jpg/500px-A_picture_from_China_every_day_300.jpg","w":1200,"h":1600,"author":"Carsten Ullrich from Shanghai, China","license":"CC BY-SA 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:A_picture_from_China_every_day_300.jpg"}},{"id":"hohhot_wv_x30942342","areaId":"hohhot","name":"小召牌楼","category":"landmark","tags":["photo"],"location":{"lat":40.7998,"lng":111.6524},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"hohhot_wv_x30942342","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsNearby":2,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-24"},"hashtags":["小召牌楼hohhot","hohhot"],"summary":"呼市召庙众多，不同召庙的地位也因不同历史事件而产生升降变化。清朝时，小召的地位一度很高，有说法叫“小召不小、大召不大”。但如今的小召人去楼空，只留下一座牌楼，立于修建在寺庙遗址上的小召小学前。","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"zh:呼和浩特","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/87/A_Monk_in_the_biggest_Temple_in_Inner_Mongolia.jpg","thumb":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/87/A_Monk_in_the_biggest_Temple_in_Inner_Mongolia.jpg","w":1200,"h":1805,"author":"hellomatt","license":"CC BY-SA 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:A_Monk_in_the_biggest_Temple_in_Inner_Mongolia.jpg"}},{"id":"hohhot_wv_x188b3db7","areaId":"hohhot","name":"观音寺","category":"landmark","tags":["photo"],"location":{"lat":40.7913,"lng":111.6476},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"hohhot_wv_x188b3db7","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://guanyinsi.fjnet.com/","official":true}],"signals":{"commonsNearby":1,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-24"},"hashtags":["观音寺hohhot","hohhot"],"summary":"观音寺是呼市最大的汉传佛教寺庙，新建的建筑群十分醒目，三重檐歇山顶看着有些夸张。马路对面的广场上是高大的白色佛塔。","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"zh:呼和浩特","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/A_picture_from_China_every_day_302.jpg/1280px-A_picture_from_China_every_day_302.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/A_picture_from_China_every_day_302.jpg/500px-A_picture_from_China_every_day_302.jpg","w":1200,"h":1600,"author":"Carsten Ullrich from Shanghai, China","license":"CC BY-SA 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:A_picture_from_China_every_day_302.jpg"}},{"id":"hohhot_wv_x7f16e4a1","areaId":"hohhot","name":"呼和浩特市规划展览馆","category":"landmark","tags":["photo"],"location":{"lat":40.8365,"lng":111.74005},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"hohhot_wv_x7f16e4a1","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.hhhtghzlg.com/","official":true}],"signals":{"commonsNearby":0,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-24"},"hashtags":["呼和浩特市规划展览馆hohhot","hohhot"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"09:00","close":"16:30"},{"open":"09:00","close":"16:30"},{"open":"09:00","close":"16:30"},{"open":"09:00","close":"16:30"},{"open":"09:00","close":"16:30"},{"open":"09:00","close":"16:30"},{"open":"09:00","close":"16:30"}]},"summary":"内蒙古博物院内藏品众多，但展出内容以内蒙古全区为主，对呼和浩特这座城市自身的介绍则寥寥无几。而附近的呼和浩特规划展览馆恰能补充这一遗憾，展示了这座城市的发展历史和建设规划。","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"zh:呼和浩特"},{"id":"hohhot_wv_x3da880e1","areaId":"hohhot","name":"乌素图召","category":"landmark","tags":["photo"],"location":{"lat":40.8268,"lng":111.5599},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"hohhot_wv_x3da880e1","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsNearby":0,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-24"},"hashtags":["乌素图召hohhot","hohhot"],"summary":"乌素图召是一组召庙的总称，包括庆缘寺（西乌素图召）、长寿寺、法禧寺、广寿寺、罗汉寺。五座寺庙以“八小召”之一的庆缘寺为中心，毗邻相连，各具特色。乌素图召位于呼市近郊的山上，依山傍水，杏柳成荫，曾以“红杏遮村”之名列入旧呼市八景。目前乌素图召正在修葺中，只有庆缘寺对外开放。乌素图召东北两公里为东乌素图，有乌素图森林公园和北极光滑雪场。","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"zh:呼和浩特"},{"id":"hohhot_wv_xc69ddcef","areaId":"hohhot","name":"乌兰恰特大剧院","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":40.8395,"lng":111.7323},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"hohhot_wv_xc69ddcef","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.wlqtpolytheatre.com/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["乌兰恰特大剧院hohhot","hohhot"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"已经加入保利院线，因此会有一些全国巡回的话剧、音乐演出来此表演。不过对旅行者来说，更有吸引力的是会有一些俄罗斯音乐团、剧团的访问演出，或是马头琴演奏会之类的民族风情表演。","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"zh:呼和浩特"}],"sources":["Wikidata (CC0)","Wikimedia Commons (counts; photos credited per file)","Wikipedia (pageviews; summaries CC BY-SA 4.0)","Wikivoyage (listings: hours, prices, descriptions; CC BY-SA 4.0)","OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL): opening hours, fees, websites"]}